{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f8b082590a24f6c6","name":"Baran Do Sage Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-f8b082590a24f6c6","title":"Baran Do Sage Talent Tree","revision":16140,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:21Z","sha256":"c599990db2ef78904de6d2ce8c8bfc8d707a9ac7b63601ff8bb89a8f51839f54","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16140","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Baran%20Do%20Sage%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f8b082590a24f6c6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Kel Dor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kel_Dor","referenceId":"reference:fb61f4510d65d959"}," who become Baran Do Sages are contemplative and insightful, using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to unravel the skeins of the past, present, and future to determine the best course of action. They are masters of ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," and other sense-related Force abilities, making them excellent as both investigators and advisors. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Baran Do Sages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Baran_Do_Sages","referenceId":"reference:368e73d8d6999f06"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Enhanced Danger Sense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +10 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Avoid Surprise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Avoid_Surprise"},". Additionally, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to act in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", even if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Expanded Horizon"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, you can sense the consequences of your actions out to 1 hour into the future (instead of the normal 10 minutes). You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," when you do so to expand this window out to 8 hours, or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," to expand this window out to 24 hours.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knowledge and Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Enhanced Danger Sense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," whenever your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus would normally be denied to you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Planetary Attunement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you arrive on a new planet, you can spend 10 minutes and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to acclimate yourself to the planet's unique ebb and flow of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," energy. While on the planet, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," against naturally occurring ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazards"}," on the world, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," increases by 1 square, and you can sense what the weather will be like to the immediate area up to 24 hours in advance as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Precognitive Meditation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per day, you can spend 10 minutes meditating to seek visions of the future. At that time, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a part of this meditation. Once during the rest of the day, whenever you or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of are the target of an attack, you can choose to negate that attack provided the attack roll is not a Natural 20. At the end of the day, if you did not use this ability, you regain the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," spent on the meditation.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
